GhostNet 1.3x: 7358820 learned / 28536 moving scalars, 227003256 kernel/SE/head/classifier MACs per image.
160->960 at 7x7: dense/ghost kernel and MAC ratio 1.893491124; excludes BN/bias/activation work. This is an arithmetic ratio, not measured speedup.
